/*
  SpeedHistogramChart.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0149 · SpeedHistogramChart (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SpeedHistogramChart` resolves (table "SpeedHistogramChart") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (features/driving/components/drive-detail/SpeedHistogramChart.tsx, plus the
  drive-detail page's section-error-boundary title). The remainder back the native
  state envelope (freshness chip, connectivity banner, loading / empty / error chrome)
  and the chart's accessibility summary.
*/

